---
description: >-
  Both styling paths for block diagrams in one small diagram: a `classDef`
  applied via `class` to block A, and a direct inline `style` statement
  applied to block B — so a regression in either the class-based or
  direct-style path shows up here.
---
block
  A["My text here"]
  B
  classDef blue fill:#66f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:#ff6;
  class A blue
  style B fill:#f9F,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px
